---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<Layout title="Thrive Pedal Play Project">
  <section class="detail-container">
    <a href={`${baseUrl}/work`} class="back-link">&larr; Back to work</a>

    <header class="project-header">
      <h1>Thrive Pedal Play Project</h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        Create and design a campaign website for a sports beer.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="main-embed-container">
      <iframe
        style="border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);"
        width="800"
        height="450"
        src="https://embed.figma.com/proto/M9lBQCMS2c1mXZyvizic27/FINAL?page-id=201%3A17943&node-id=201-17990&viewport=159%2C225%2C0.09&scaling=scale-down&content-scaling=fixed&embed-host=share"
        allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>

    <article class="project-story">
      <h2>The Project</h2>
      <p>
        For this project, we had to create a complete campaign website for a
        sports beer brand, and design a website for that campaign. We had to
        keep the design consistent with the brand's identity and core values.
        <br /><br />
        After research and brainsotming, I came up with a campaign involving cycling
        and electricity. When you cycle, you can measure your energy output in Watts,
        and these Watts can (in theory) be used to brew Thrive beer. I calculated
        it would take the average person about 39km of cycling to produce enough energy
        for one can of Thrive beer.
        <br /><br />
        So in this campaign, we call people to take part in a cycling challenge to
        raise awareness about sustainable energy and promote the Thrive brand. They
        can track their progress, but the most important thing is the collective impact.
        <br /><br />
        I tried to translate this into a modern design, using light/electric blue, symbolizing electricity, and dark red, symbolizing CO2 emissions.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .detail-container {
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  .back-link {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .project-header {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem 0;
  }
  .project-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
  }
  .tagline {
    color: #8586ff;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* Responsive Figma Embed Container */
  .main-embed-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;

  }

  .main-embed-container iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }

  .project-story {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  .project-story h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
